WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:11,240
After dinner

2
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:13,740
In the afternoon, you two will go to the underground garage to fight.

3
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:15,640
Practice your hands and feet well

4
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:17,360
Encounter an enemy

5
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:19,160
I won't take action against anything you can handle.

6
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:22,170
This is what you should do as a female subordinate.

7
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:23,370
what are you afraid of

8
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:24,470
Even if you are injured and about to die

9
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:28,170
I can even bring you back. Don’t worry, boss.

10
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:29,970
Then why don't you practice together?

11
00:00:29,970 --> 00:00:31,170
I don't have to

12
00:00:31,170 --> 00:01:27,320
The pure art of grinding teeth is enough.

13
00:01:27,320 --> 00:01:28,620
Training ends today
